# Sentry Config File
.env.sentry-build-plugin

# [ANDROID] Never commit signing keys, key credentials, or built app packages.
# Losing the keystore means you can never update the Play listing again; leaking
# it (or its passwords) lets anyone ship malicious updates as BoekBrug. Keep them
# backed up OUTSIDE the repo.
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
*.aab
*.apk
# PWABuilder's key-credentials file (contains keystore + key passwords in plain text)
signingkeyinfo.txt
signing-key-info*
*signing*info*

# [ANDROID] Generated Play Store marketing assets (regenerate via scripts/generate-store-assets.mjs)
store-assets/
